# StudyFlow247 - Netlify Redirects & API Proxy Configuration
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# When your Node.js/Express backend is deployed (e.g. on Render):
# Update the URL below with your actual deployed backend URL:
# Example: /api/*  https://studyflow-backend.onrender.com/api/:splat  200!
#
# This enables the frontend to make relative calls to "/api/*" without CORS
# or mixed-content issues. Netlify's CDN seamlessly proxies them to the backend.

/api/*  https://studyflow-backend.onrender.com/api/:splat  200!

